==Description==
'''Paradoxum Games''' is a Roblox group focused primarily on developing games, though it also has some avatar items also on sale. It is a public group owned by BelowNatural with a total of 13 ranks.

'''Paradoxum Games''' currently actively develops two games — Tower Defense Simulator and ALTER EGO. The former is a tower defense game where players defend against hordes of enemies with their towers. ALTER EGO is the newest game developed by the studio, an asymmetric horror game. '''Paradoxum Games''' also has had various [[#Cancelled Projects|cancelled projects]] which were teased or mentioned, but never released.

'''Paradoxum Games''' also has a variety of avatar items. Most of them are themed around Tower Defense Simulator, with some at first being only obtainable through gameplay before being sold as limited items. Others can be bought at any time like regular marketplace items. It also sell a few '''Paradoxum Games''' themed items, some of which are only obtainable by being a part of their staff team.

'''Paradoxum Games''' has its own [https://paradoxum.gg/ website] and [https://shop.paradoxum.games/ merch store]. They also have various social media accounts, including X accounts ([https://x.com/paradoxum_games Tower Defense Simulator] and [https://x.com/play_alterego ALTER EGO]), two Discord servers ([https://discord.gg/tds Tower Defense Simulator] and [https://discord.gg/amfBrEnE ALTER EGO]), [https://www.youtube.com/@ParadoxumGames YouTube channel], [https://www.reddit.com/r/TDS_Roblox/ Reddit subreddit], [https://www.twitch.tv/paradoxum_games Twitch channel] and a [https://www.tiktok.com/@paradoxum.games TikTok account].

