==Ranks==
These are all the ranks in the group and all the known benefits from having them. Unless stated otherwise, benefits for each rank will apply to ranks higher than it. In most cases, being demoted also leads to losing benefits from that rank.

Only includes benefits in the group or in Tower Defense Simulator. Other benefits (like in the Tower Defense Simulator Discord) are not included.
*Player (1)
**Starting cash is boosted by {{Money|100}} unless the mode disables it.
*Content Creator (2)
**Starting from this point, each player is given [[Titles]] based on the rank they have.
**Free cam is unlocked.
*Quality Assurance (3)
**Ability to post on the group's wall.
*Contributor (4)
*Moderator (5)
**[[War Machine]] is given out through the [[Gift Box]].
*Administrator (10)
**[[Mecha Base]] is given out through the [[Gift Box]].
*Bot (250)
*Community Manager (250)
*Contractor (251)
**[[Static Nametag]] is given out through the [[Gift Box]].
*Developer (252)
**Adds the dev tag in chat.
*Programmer (253)
*Gameplay Programmer (253)
*BelowNatural (255)

