**A tower defense game which would function similarly to freeplace mode in ''Tower Heroes'', most likely called [https://www.roblox.com/games/5945696092/Zombie-Defense Zombie Defense]. This game was mentioned by Beefchoplets once and never teased.
**A skyblock fighting game, most likely called [https://www.roblox.com/games/5710879332/SkyBlox SkyBlox]. This game was mentioned by Beefchoplets once and never teased.
**A remake of ''The Undeground War'' by Stickmasterluke, most likely called [https://www.roblox.com/games/4971957140/Woodfields Woodfields].<gallery>
